  The slides_spec and caption describe the drunken group 'கூட்டமாக வருகின்றனர்' and the article's arrests or action are not mentioned, but the key article fact that the petrol self-immolation was caused by debt is kept only partially; the reel says 'கடன் பிரச்னையால்' correctly, so this is minor.
  The article states the devotees sacrifice goats and chickens and cook food at the temple; this important detail is missing from the reel_script and was not mentioned, though it is not strictly required.
  The reel_script says 'பொதுமக்கள் அச்சம் தெரிவித்துள்ளனர்' about the illegal acts, while the article attributes the fear mainly to the drinkers' nuisance; this attribution is acceptable but the caption's phrase 'சட்டவிரோதச் செயல்கள் நடைபெறுவதாகப் பொதுமக்கள் அச்சம் தெரிவித்துள்ளனர்' merges two facts (fear and the illegal acts) into one sentence.
